WEBVTT

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.976
And I said, there

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:34.976
is a way to get a frog
up to where he wants to go.

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:35.976
(Laughter)

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:38.976
So I started developing --

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:41.000
you know, George's dad had a lot of help.
I just had my brother.

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:44.976
But I -- it took me
about -- it took me about,

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:46.976
I'd say, six months

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:49.048
to finally figure
out all the little things.

00:15:49.072 --> 00:15:50.976
There's a lot of little things involved

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:53.191
in making a rocket that it
will actually work,

00:15:53.215 --> 00:15:54.976
even after you have the fuel.

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:56.976
But you do it, by -- what I just--

00:15:57.000 --> 00:15:58.976
you know, you do experiments,

00:15:59.000 --> 00:15:59.976
and you write down things sometimes,

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.976
you make observations, you know.